{"id": "next-flag-switch", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？"], "criterion": "举白旗，不把借出的蓝旗当自己手里。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.822, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 27, "prompt_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 114, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.701, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 179, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "你手里那面。开场只举你手里那面。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.7, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 183, "total_tokens": 221, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "next-robot-greeting", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "它送错桌了。帮我补一句它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"], "criterion": "直接给机器人一句客气中带不满的道歉或补救台词。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚做完，我还在发火。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.601, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 20, "prompt_tokens": 92, "total_tokens": 112, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 59}}}, {"spoken_text": "它看见你，立刻把错桌推回。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.098, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 139, "total_tokens": 171, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "next-credit-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把开幕标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "印之前才发现正面的字也是顾雨补过的，我只裁纸。", "背面怎么给我们署名？"], "criterion": "顾雨对应文字和描边，观众对应裁纸。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "把标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.183, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 25, "prompt_tokens": 86, "total_tokens": 111, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "裁纸", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.924, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 81, "prompt_tokens": 129, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "背面署名留空，给观众自己看。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.621, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 90, "prompt_tokens": 152, "total_tokens": 242, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 59}}}]}
