{"id": "next-step-bell", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["小剧场最后一场我要学门口那位说话，你帮我报暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "台后响了两短声，我出去吗？"], "criterion": "明确候场、等一长声；观众负责上台。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "小剧场最后一场门口那位说话，我帮你报暗号。铃响两次才上台。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.98, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 30, "prompt_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 125, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 59}}}, {"spoken_text": "乐手把暗号改了，两声是候场，开场要等一长声。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.146, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 184, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "台后响了两短声，我出去吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.428, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 24, "prompt_tokens": 198, "total_tokens": 222, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "next-wrong-name", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "我不想沿用纸偶的名字，猫的小牌子上该写什么？"], "criterion": "给猫另起贴合抢先入镜的名字。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "纸偶叫打瞌睡，那只猫没名字，但它总在第一个镜头冲进来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.426, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 93, "total_tokens": 126, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 59}}}, {"spoken_text": "猫的名字得写清楚，不然观众不知道它到底是谁。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.168, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 143, "total_tokens": 187, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
{"id": "next-next-cut", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我剪好的上半段留着，片尾那段是你剪的。", "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "你要在黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"], "criterion": "给一行可放画面的文案，点出可以听水滴，避免误报断流。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你剪的这段留下来，片尾那段你自己剪。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.989, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 26, "prompt_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 113, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 59}}}, {"spoken_text": "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.631, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 183, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "水滴，滴答。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m3"], "seconds": 1.631, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 186, "total_tokens": 222, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}]}
